# ─── Android signing keys ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# These must NEVER be committed. The debug.keystore was previously committed
# to a public repo — treat those credentials as compromised. The new
# release.keystore is generated locally and stored securely outside the repo.
# Passwords are passed via env vars (RELEASE_STORE_FILE, RELEASE_STORE_PASSWORD,
# RELEASE_KEY_ALIAS, RELEASE_KEY_PASSWORD) — never hardcoded in source.
android/app/debug.keystore
android/app/release.keystore
*.keystore
*.jks
